 ("alloy", "The NDT temperature can also be lowered by small additions of selected alloying elements such as nickel and manganese to low-carbon steels.", BF, 2),
 ("fast", "Consequently, during operation the reactor vessel is subjected to an increasing fluence (flux) of fast neutrons, and as a result the NDT temperature increases steadily.", BF, 2),
